{
  "key": "letter-010-part-02",
  "number": 10,
  "generationId": "01a1e4e8-d894-7d96-aa83-e969018a79ef",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Your very existence, your very life, is in the ocean.",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.078866
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "It is within you.",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/12.mp3",
      "start": 4.216327,
      "end": 5.208413
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "The ocean is your everything, but for the ocean, you are nothing.",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/13.mp3",
      "start": 6.358277,
      "end": 10.089160999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "For this very reason the fish couldn't see the ocean!",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/14.mp3",
      "start": 11.193243,
      "end": 14.072448999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "And for this very reason we are unable to find God.",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/15.mp3",
      "start": 15.156780000000001,
      "end": 18.000522
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "But he can be found - by being empty.",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/16.mp3",
      "start": 19.108458,
      "end": 21.887687
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "In the state of emptiness we meet him for God is emptiness.",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/17.mp3",
      "start": 23.460770999999998,
      "end": 27.448254000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I am in bliss, or shall I say - Bliss alone is and I am not!",
      "path": "audio/1963-10/18.mp3",
      "start": 28.887959,
      "end": 34.04
    }
  ]
}
